<H2>Restaurants</H2>
<P align=justify>
<P align=justify><SPAN>For culinary nirvana smart people head to the land of 
eatopia, our city Lucknow where gourmet delights range from kebabs, biryani to 
pasta and tacos. So spread out the daterkhwan, learn the nuances of chopstick 
management, develop the taste for super – spicy kebabs as well as very bland 
hummus and be ready to experiment coz we are taking you on an all our 
gastronomic blast. </SPAN></P>
<P align=justify>Lucknow’s most famous food joints adopt the smartest 
advertising strategy of all times. No sign-board, no phone lines and no 
marketing fundas – this works well for Idris Biryaniwala at Patanala Chowk, 
Rahim kulche-nahari eatery at Chowk, the typed to death yet still the best Tunde 
kebabs at Akbari Gate, top it off with Naushejaan, Sakhawat, Daal mein Kaala, 
Dasterkhwan and you have eateries that are pocket friendly and find pride of 
place in national and intertnational good food guides. If money is no problem 
then there are also the kakori kebabs to kill for at the Oudhyana, <STRONG>Taj 
Residency</STRONG> or the ghazal soaked yummy evening at Falaknuma in <A 
href="http://www.lucknowcity.com/clarks.php">l </A><STRONG>Clarks Avadh</STRONG> 
or the sizzler delights at Pavillion at <STRONG>Park Inn</STRONG>.</P>
